Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: restore SM-G955N codec SPI feedback delay

Carry over the codec MISO sampling phase from the Samsung
SM-G955N tree. Linux 6.18 interprets this peripheral property
inside the same controller-data node.

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/exynos8895-dream2lteks.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/exynos8895-dream2lteks.dts
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/exynos8895-dream2lteks.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/exynos8895-dream2lteks.dts
@@ -437,4 +437,8 @@
 		CPVDD2-supply = <&g955n_codec_1v2>;
 		DCVDD-supply = <&g955n_codec_1v2>;
+
+		controller-data {
+			samsung,spi-feedback-delay = <1>;
+		};
 	};
 };
